### ===== TOKEN SETUP =====
### Paste your tokens here after logging in (from auth.http)
### Format: @variable_name = token_value

@admin_token = 
@professor_token = 
@student_token = 

### ===== COURSE ENDPOINTS =====
### This file contains all course-related requests with role-based access tests
### Token Variables: @admin_token, @professor_token, @student_token

### Admin: Get all courses (ALLOWED)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses
Authorization: Bearer @admin_token

###

### Professor: Get all courses (ALLOWED)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses
Authorization: Bearer @professor_token

###

### Student: Get all courses (ALLOWED)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses
Authorization: Bearer @student_token

###

### Get course by ID (All roles allowed)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses/1
Authorization: Bearer @admin_token

###

### Admin: Create course (ALLOWED)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer @admin_token

{
  "id": 1,
  "departmentId": 1,
  "code": "CS101",
  "name": "Introduction to Computer Science",
  "description": "Basic fundamentals of computer science",
  "credits": 3.0
}

###

### Professor: Create course (DENIED - 403 Forbidden)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer @professor_token

{
  "id": 2,
  "departmentId": 1,
  "code": "CS102",
  "name": "Data Structures",
  "description": "Advanced data structures",
  "credits": 4.0
}

###

### Student: Create course (DENIED - 403 Forbidden)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer @student_token

{
  "id": 3,
  "departmentId": 1,
  "code": "CS103",
  "name": "Algorithms",
  "description": "Algorithm analysis",
  "credits": 4.0
}

###

### Admin: Update course (ALLOWED)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/courses/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer @admin_token

{
  "id": 1,
  "departmentId": 1,
  "code": "CS101",
  "name": "Intro to CS - Updated",
  "description": "Updated description",
  "credits": 3.5
}

###

### Professor: Update course (DENIED - 403 Forbidden)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/courses/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer @professor_token

{
  "id": 1,
  "departmentId": 1,
  "code": "CS101",
  "name": "Intro to CS - Professor Update",
  "description": "Professor update",
  "credits": 3.0
}

###

### Admin: Delete course (ALLOWED)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/courses/1
Authorization: Bearer @admin_token

###

### Professor: Delete course (DENIED - 403 Forbidden)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/courses/1
Authorization: Bearer @professor_token

###
